m{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2GaleStewartGame}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2GaleStewartGame}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span> 仅对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使用；函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2GaleStewartGame}_S(G,A,P)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\exists\\operatorname{turn}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(A^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},A^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\})\\land\\forall s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{turn}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2)\\land G=(A^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{turn},P)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2GaleStewartGame}_S(G,A,P)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\exists\\operatorname{turn}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(A^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},A^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\})\\land\\forall s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{turn}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\bmod2)\\land G=(A^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{turn},P)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h